          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "拖移绘制椭圆 · Shift 加选 · Option 减选 · 拖动中再按 Shift 为正圆 · 在框内拖移可移动 · Delete 清除 · ⌘D 取消选择"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Drag inside the wheel. Angle sets hue, distance sets saturation.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在色轮内拖移：角度决定色相，距离决定饱和度。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
