            "value": "直方图"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hold Shift to add or Option to subtract for one outline": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "按住 Shift 加选、按住 Option 减选，只针对一次轮廓"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Horizontal": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "水平"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How bright a light has to be to flare; near 100, only the biggest, brightest spots": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "产生耀斑所需的亮度；接近 100 时只有最大最亮的光点才会出现"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How bright a light has to be to sparkle; near 100, only the biggest, brightest spots": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "产生星芒所需的亮度；接近 100 时只有最大最亮的光点才会出现"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How bright the lines are where the picture is black, so they show even over black": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "画面全黑处线条的亮度，使其在纯黑上仍可见"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How brightly lights open into discs": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "光源散开成光斑的亮度"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How far a color may be from the picked ones and still be selected": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "颜色与已拾取颜色的差异在此范围内仍会被选中"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How far apart the copies are": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "重影之间的间距"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How far apart the screen's lines are": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "扫描线的间距"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How far each color channel (0–255) can differ from the clicked color and still be selected": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "各颜色通道 (0–255) 与点按处颜色的差异在此范围内仍会被选中"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How far from each edge the sharpening reaches, in pixels.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "锐化从各边缘延伸的距离（像素）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How far in brightness the adjustment reaches.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "调整在亮度上的作用范围。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How far in hue the adjustment reaches.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "调整在色相上的作用范围。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How far in saturation the adjustment reaches.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "调整在饱和度上的作用范围。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How far out of focus: the size of each disc": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "失焦程度：每个光斑的大小"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How far the blur softens, in pixels": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "模糊柔化的范围，单位为像素"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How far the brightness is smoothed before it displaces the lines, from sharp ridges to rounded hills": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "亮度在推移线条前的平滑程度：从锐利的脊线到圆缓的丘陵"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How far the colors spread apart, red one way and blue the other": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "颜色分离的距离，红蓝各朝一侧"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How far the lens's coatings turn each streak blue along its length; none keeps the light's own color": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "镜头镀膜使光条沿长度方向偏蓝的程度；最低时保持光源本色"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How far the light spreads": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "光线的扩散范围"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How far the light wraps around the subject's edges": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "光线环绕主体边缘的范围"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How far the spikes reach": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "星芒的延伸长度"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How far the streaks reach across the picture": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "光条横跨画面的长度"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How fine the detail it sharpens: small for crisp texture, larger for a punchier look": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "锐化的细节尺度：数值小则质感清晰，数值大则更具冲击力"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How long each frame shows": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每帧显示时长"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How many spikes each light has, as the lens's aperture blades make them": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每个光源的星芒数，如同镜头光圈叶片造成的样子"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How many times the picture echoes, each fainter": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "画面的重影次数，一次比一次淡"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How much light scatters: a soft halo around bright areas, and gently lifted shadows": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "光线散射的程度：亮部周围出现柔和光晕，暗部被轻轻提亮"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How much of each pixel's error spreads to its neighbors. Less gives flatter areas": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每个像素的误差向邻近扩散的比例；越小则色块越平"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How much of the gap a bright line fills; dimmer parts draw it thinner": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "亮线占据间隙的比例；较暗处画得更细"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How much of the profile distortion correction is applied.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "应用配置文件畸变校正的程度。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How much of the profile vignetting correction is applied.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "应用配置文件晕影校正的程度。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How strongly edges and fine detail are brought out": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "边缘与细节被强调的强度"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How the light ends on the inside: low feathers it off softly from the edge, high holds it bright and ends it crisply": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "光在内侧的收束方式：低值从边缘柔和淡出，高值保持明亮并干脆收住"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How the line's ends, and each of its dashes and dots, are finished": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "线条两端以及每一段虚线和点的收尾方式"
          }
        }
      }
    },
