      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "线性沿直线模糊；径向保持起点清晰，向外逐渐模糊"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Linear histogram with automatic vertical scaling. Tall spikes may extend beyond the graph; all tones from 0 to 255 remain included.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "线性直方图，纵向自动缩放。高尖峰可能超出图表，0 到 255 的所有色调仍完整计入。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Linear runs along the line; Radial spreads out from the start point": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "线性沿直线延伸；径向从起点向外扩散"
