            "value": "像玻璃那样分离每个重影的红蓝；0 保持重影清晰"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Split the layer's original channels into four grayscale layers, Red, Green, Blue and Alpha, for Export As › Channel Pack. Color under fully transparent pixels can't be recovered": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "把图层的原始通道拆成红、绿、蓝、Alpha 四个灰度图层，用于「导出为 › 通道打包」。完全透明像素下的颜色无法恢复"
