            "state": "translated",
            "value": "画笔像被这么长的线牵着跟随指针，手抖也能画出平滑的线"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The characters to draw with, in any order: each spot gets the one whose ink best matches its tone": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "用于绘制的字符，顺序不限：每个位置使用墨色最接近其色调的那个字符"
